{{> head officeStyles=true}}<body class="office">{{> staffNav}}<main id="main" class="office-main">{{> officeFlash}}<header class="page-heading"><div><h1>{{title}}</h1><p>{{#if integrations}}Connection capabilities and external setup requirements.{{else}}Application health and maintenance information for authorized administrators.{{/if}}</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="/api">API documentation</a></header>
{{#if operations}}<section class="panel"><h2>Application health</h2><div class="detail-strip"><div><strong>{{database}}</strong><span>Database</span></div><div><strong>{{uptime}} min</strong><span>Process uptime</span></div><div><strong>{{memory}} MB</strong><span>Process memory</span></div></div><p>Sessions expire after 30 minutes of inactivity and persist in the database.</p><p>HTTPS-only cookies: <strong>{{#if secureCookies}}enabled{{else}}not enabled in this environment{{/if}}</strong></p><p>Backup encryption key: <strong>{{#if backupConfigured}}configured{{else}}not configured{{/if}}</strong></p><p>Last successful encrypted backup: <strong>{{lastBackup}}</strong></p><p class="muted">Backup and restoration commands are in the project’s maintenance guide. Infrastructure encryption, firewall rules, replication and recovery targets must be configured for the deployment.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Database capacity</h2><p class="small muted">Row estimates are provided by MySQL. Storage bytes include data and indexes.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table class="office-table"><thead><tr><th>Table</th><th>Estimated rows</th><th>Storage bytes</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each tables}}<tr><td>{{name}}</td><td>{{rows}}</td><td>{{bytes}}</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div></section>{{/if}}
{{#if integrations}}<section class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="office-table"><thead><tr><th>Capability</th><th>Status</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each connections}}<tr><td>{{name}}</td><td><span class="badge">{{status}}</span></td><td>{{detail}}</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div></section>{{/if}}</main>{{> officeFooter}}</body></html>

